1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your side mirror stopped moving —
and the buttons don't do anything.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
No motor sound, no click, nothing.
Could be one mirror, or both.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: it's usually the switch,
the mirror motor, or a blown fuse —
three different fixes.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
If only one side is dead, that narrows it fast.
If neither moves, check the fuse first.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which part it is.
A quick check can point to the actual cause.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before you order the wrong part.
Stop by and we'll take a look. Nick's Tire & Auto.
